            We’re a creative duo from Spain who fell into advertising by chance — then fell harder for the world of ideas.
          </p>

          <p>
            Since then, we’ve worked with some of the best people and brands around: 
            <strong>De’Longhi</strong>, <strong>Rexona</strong>, <strong>Axe</strong>, <strong>OMO</strong>, <strong>Tropicana</strong>, <strong>Burger King</strong> and <strong>Bayer</strong>.
            Always learning, never bored, usually caffeinated.
          </p>

          <p>
            Beyond all that, we’re quite nice (or so we’ve heard). 
            One of us has an unhealthy relationship with Wordplay™ and the other can’t stop talking. 
            Together, we think it makes us pretty good company — for briefings and for beers.
          </p>
